{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_33.json","id":69334,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Amplified Creatine XXX Power Fruit Punch","brandName":"GNC Pro Performance AMP","brandIpSymbol":"®","upcSku":"0 48107 13729 8","productVersionCode":"CODE 370076 IPG","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"28","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Image difference, same product","labelId":33592}],"contacts":[{"contactId":1167,"text":"Distributed by:","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1167,"name":"General Nutrition Corporation","streetAddress":"","city":"Pittsburgh","state":"PA","country":"","zipCode":"15222","phoneNumber":"1-888-462-2548","email":"","webAddress":"gnc.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":16.57,"unit":"oz.","display":"16.57 oz."},{"order":2,"quantity":1.04,"unit":"lb","display":"1.04 lb"},{"order":3,"quantity":469.84,"unit":"Gram(s)","display":"469.84 Gram(s)"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":8.39,"maxQuantity":16.78,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":1,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1-2 scoops","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warning: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, have a medical condition or are taking medication."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"6 products in one"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"AMP"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Informed-choice.org Trusted by sport Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by LGC Science, Inc., a world-class anti-doping lad. Product was tested for over 145 banned substances on the 2015 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via LGC Skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307. see gnc.com for more information."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Daily\nPre/post-workout"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Stamina\nPower"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"The evolution of performance supplementation\nGNC's most advanced creatine formula, Amplified Creatine XXX, has evolved even further with the launch of Amplified Creatine XXX Power, the line's first and only creatine formulated to help give you enhanced performance and strength. This unique formula features an unstoppable bend of 4 key forms of creatine designed to provide an instant release of creatine and using the GNC exclusive Optimal Timing Technology(OT2), a form that releases over 6 hours."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"The OT2 allows for a 6-hour extended release of creatine to feed your muscles before, during, and after your toughest workouts to maximize your results."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"To take you even further, it's also packed with creatine precursors."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Power complex\nCombines agmatine with betaine anhydrous for added power and performance plus beta alanine to help buffer muscle carnosine levels, a key marker for muscle fatigue. Features choline and CoQ-10."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Choline is essential for making acetylcholine, a messenger chemical that is important in sending messages form one nerve cell to another. CoQ-10 is important for mitochondria function and is involved in the process that produces cellular energy and boosts ATP."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"~ Build power & performance with 5g multi-phase creatine complex for extreme workouts \n~ Enhance power with 2.5g Betaine & combat a key muscle fatigue with 1g Beta-Alanine"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Banned substance free"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"OT2 Optimal Timing Technology"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Clinically researched"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural + artificial flavors"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 370076 IPG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, mix 1 scoop (8.39 g) with 4-5 fl. oz. of water or your favorite beverage, pre, during, or post-workout. For maximum results, mix 2 scoops (16.78 g) with 8-10 fl. oz. of water or your favorite beverage pre-workout and sip throughout your workout to power your training.\nConsume ample amounts of water while taking this product."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Servings per container 56 28"},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, have a medical condition or are taking medication."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Notice: Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Per 2 scoop serving"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Carnosyn \nCarnosine Synthesizer"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Carnosyn trademark and patents owned by Natural Alternatives International, Inc."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"BETAPOWER\nNatural Betaine"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BETAPOWER is a registered trademark of DuPont or its affiliates."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Informed-choice.org \nTrusted by sport"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Loaded with 4 unique creatine sources, including OT2 creatine, creatine HCL, creatine ethyl ester and creatine citrate this powerful formula helps increase strength and build lean muscle."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Amplified Creatine XXX Power features 6 Products in 1!\n1. Creatine\n2. Betaine\n3. Agmatine Sulfate\n4. Beta-Alanine\n5. Choline\n6, CoQ-10"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Who can benefit from taking Amplified Creatine XXX Power?\nAmplified Creatine XXX Power has re-engineered the use for creatine supplements."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"If your goal is to increase strength and power, this formula is for you. You can customize your dosing and supplementation regimen to meet your specific training goals and nutrition needs."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Advanced creatine complex & creatine precursor compound\nThis breakthrough formula was created with the ultimate goal of enhancing athletic performance by combining powerful doses of clinically proven ingredients to provide the strength and power benefits of an advanced creatine blend."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2017-01-25","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,